	(text "AdeptBT rev 0.3 — JLCPCB-first schematic\\nMCU U1 Raytac MDBT50Q-1MV2 (C5118826)  |  U2/U3 TMC2209-LA (C465949)\\nJ_STEP1/2 + J_PWR: TE 2383941-6 (C3816695)  |  J_DC: 5.5x2.1 barrel\\nGPIO lock: AIN0-3=P0.02-05; OUT1/2=P0.06/08; shared TMC_UART=P0.14;\\n  STEP1 STEP/DIR/EN=P0.21/20/13; STEP2 STEP/DIR/EN=P0.16/15/17;\\n  D0-3=P0.23/22/P1.00/P0.24; LED=P0.07; CHG_STAT=P0.25\\nPower: VIN_RAW (screw+barrel)→PPTC→P-FET→SMBJ24A→VIN; buck AP63205;\\n  MCP73871→VBAT; AMS1117→+3V3. Finish discretes in KiCad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
